id=audio_policy_fix
name=Dolby Spatializer Fix [Pong ATMOS]
version=v2.1
versionCode=210
author=deadrator
description=Dolby spatializer + TWS fix for Poco M5 (rock/stone), Android 16. Registers the android.hardware.audio.spatializer feature, exposes a dedicated Bluetooth spatializer output, and restores the deep-buffer A2DP profile for stutter-free playback with the spatializer stage active. No effects-config overlay: the ROM's stock audio_effects.xml already registers libswspatializer.
